review={'schema_version':'1.0.0','review_id':rid,'kind':'batch','repository':ins['repository'],'title':'Independent selenite alias successor and three exact stock deferrals','started_at':'2026-11-08T17:00:51.969405Z','finished_at':at,'reviewer':{'identity':'Codex /root/step7d_science_c','kind':'agent','independence':'independent','independence_basis':'A/next23_context authored these exact Na and deferral bytes, W01 authored source proposals, root selected deferral policy. C did not author these candidate/bridge bytes. C previously authored coordinator plans and other candidates; own three-method successors are excluded. This private evidence fixture is not a production baseline or application authorization.'},'skill':'review-yaml-record','completion':'completed','verdict':'pass_with_limitations','scientific_review':True,'summary':'The complete private Na owner passes the scoped identity/alias applicability and preservation review; the exact three-operation stock deferral bridge preserves supported source facts and unresolved continuity. No new finding. Native actual-KG diagnostic confirms the unsafe alias is removed; no source application or export approval.','source':ins['source'],'targets':targets,'scope':{'description':'One complete private Na owner and one exact three-operation/four-case deferral bridge, with independent primary/history and source-lineage checks.','selection':'Exact candidate56b2ec00 and bridge d4034703 from immutable author695d/MANIFEST61e1.','coverage':'full','population_size':2,'reviewed_target_ids':ids,'exclusions':[{'target':'Whole corrected campaign, own three-method candidates and actual final rows','reason':'Separate exact independent scientific/technical reviews and future actual generation are required.'},{'target':'Resolution of DSMZ863/973 reagent identity and stock equivalence/continuity','reason':'These source conditions remain unresolved and are explicitly preserved, not silently cleared.'},{'target':'Fresh whole-role, occurrence-quantity and supported-export approval','reason':'Unchanged inherited fields and prior holds are retained; this review does not decide those domains.'}]},'checks':checks,'assessments':ass,'evidence':ev,'findings':[],'actions':[],'limitations':['Underlying raw Edison research was not independently re-researched. Its actual historical merge commit, official current captures and case hold support the narrow resolver-exposure conclusion; no claim of a different original reagent.','The3 deferred creates remain scientifically usable source-profile proposals with unresolved owner continuity; deferral is not deletion, rejection of the printed recipe, merge approval or source-case outcome change.','All actual native row checks are bounded per-owner diagnostics with actual KGgzip, authentic A842 inventory and cached official labels; no provider query, full corrected-campaign generation, residual accounting or prior-stamp replay.','The initial read-only GH network failure is retained. Subsequent successful read-only captures are the issue evidence; no absence was inferred from failure.','No maintained/worker/partial-B source, original plan/acceptance, GitHub or process state was changed. Only an exclusively owned private evidence Git fixture was initialized and snapshotted for native review saving.','The final corrected plan must consume the actual reviewed bytes and disposition, preserve all original case/origin evidence, and obtain its own native admission and real-output review.'], 'notes':['#718 comment6724233754 and #1237 comment6724234025 were filed before authoring these artifacts. This review closes no issue and does not rewrite older findings.']}
